tion="default" data-v-52061f53><div class="landing-feature-banner2__container" data-v-52061f53><div class="landing-feature-banner2__image-container" data-v-52061f53><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdFpbqstJ9-ini_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8021.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier is entering the rear of a house through a side gate. He is carrying two parcels to drop off." width="8192" height="5464" class="landing-feature-banner2__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-52061f53></div><div class="landing-feature-banner2__content--standard landing-feature-banner2__content" data-v-52061f53><div class="e-label e-label--variant-brand-04 landing-feature-banner2__label" data-test-id="e-label" data-v-52061f53 data-v-a0e028ea><span class="e-label__value--dark e-label__value" data-test-id="label-text" data-v-a0e028ea>New!</span></div><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner2__title" data-v-52061f53>Send 0-2kg parcels for less</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner2__rich-text landing-feature-banner2__rich-text--standard" data-v-52061f53><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our brand-new small parcel delivery option gives you a much more affordable way to send parcels. Save up to 26% or £1.27 on every parcel that fits our new ‘small’ size in our Summer Sale (ends 31/08/2026).<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Small parcel delivery is perfect for lighter, more compact parcels measuring up to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->45cm x 35cm x 16cm <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->and weighing up to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->2kg. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your parcel is larger, you can still send it using our standard parcel service.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whichever option you choose, you’ll still save, with Evri costing up to 17% less than Royal Mail Click &amp; Drop. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your item fits through a letterbox, you may be able to send it <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->even cheaper<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> as a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/postable" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Postable parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="how-much-does-it-cost-to-send-a-small-parcel?" class="section-wrapper information-table__section" index="2" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 data-v-1dc8ab9e>How much does it cost to send a small parcel?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-1dc8ab9e>You can now send a small 1-2kg parcel with Next Day delivery for less than a standard 1-2kg parcel with our normal delivery speed. Compare our standard and small parcel sizes to see how much you could save on both Standard and Next Day delivery.</p><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight &amp; Speed</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard parcel</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Small parcel</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Savings</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard 0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.25</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard 1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.52</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.27</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day 0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.12</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.90</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.22</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day 1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.48</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.60</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.88</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Collection 0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.30</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.26</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Collection 1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.78</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.52</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.26</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__footer-text" data-v-1dc8ab9e><small data-v-1dc8ab9e>These prices are given for our small parcel service where your parcel measures up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm and weighs up to 2kg. Standard delivery is 2-4 day delivery. Next Day delivery is 1-2 day delivery.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-1dc8ab9e><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-2 e-button--icon-right e-button--link" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-1dc8ab9e style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a small parcel<!--]--></span></a></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="compare-our-prices-to-royal-mail" class="section-wrapper information-table__section" index="3" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 data-v-1dc8ab9e>Compare our prices to Royal Mail</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-1dc8ab9e>Our summer sale gives you up to 17% cheaper pricing for small parcels than the Royal Mail’s Click &amp; Drop equivalent.</p><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight &amp; Speed</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Evri Small Parcel</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Royal Mail Small Parcel</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Savings</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard 0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.61</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard 1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.52</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.13</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day 0-1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.90</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.75</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day 1-2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.60</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.05</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__footer-text" data-v-1dc8ab9e><small data-v-1dc8ab9e>Comparisons are made to the Royal Mail Click &amp; Drop prices for small, tracked UK parcels and were compared on 01/07/2026.. Please find the Royal Mail prices here: https://www.royalmail.com/sending/send-small-parcels</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-1dc8ab9e><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="are-you-vat-registered?" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0" index="4" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Are you VAT registered?</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptopc413.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="should-i-send-a-postable-or-small-parcel?" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_77608a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A father is measuring the sides of his parcel at home at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Should I send a Postable or small parcel?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your item fits through a letterbox, you can send it as a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/postable" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Postable parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It must be: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Up to 23cm x 35cm x 3cm <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Between 250g and 1kg in weight <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your parcel measures up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm and weighs up to 2kg, you can choose to send it as a small parcel. This is a great option if your parcel is too large for Postable, or if you would like the added reassurance of extra cover and delivery features. Sending a small parcel includes free parcel cover up to £20, with the option to upgrade cover up to £999 and add a digital signature. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you’re sending baby clothes, books, homewares or other small items, our small parcel service offers a simple way to send at a cheaper price. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your parcel is larger than this, you can send it as a standard sized parcel. Prices will depend on its weight. You can choose to upgrade to next day and add additional cover to your parcel too.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For more information on parcel weights and measurements, we recommend reading our parcel size and weight guide. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Parcel size and weight guide" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send/parcel-size-and-weight-guide" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11